dashboard/CLI edits the KERNEL (comments via the broker) and the user's own
human-driven Claude Code session reads it via SUPPORTED hooks on its next natural
turn. NEVER stdin injection, never drives the agent programmatically — kernel data
+ official hooks ONLY (per the Anthropic Usage Policy; see kernel 6d10c1a1).

- forge inbox / --json / ack <id> (lib/commands/inbox.js + lib/inbox.js): lists
  unacked, instruction-tagged, targeted dashboard comments across claimed issues +
