- Targeting resolves the session from the active kernel claim (actor+session_id+
  worktree_id) with an honest fallback (session null -> route by worktree, then
  actor floor), all labeled best-effort.
- SessionStart pickup: fetchInbox as a third fenced (dashboard-comment) section in
  memory-digest.collectDigestData, budget-capped.
- UserPromptSubmit pickup: new inbox-pickup context intent (fail-open) — Claude
  renders it (near-real-time tier); Cursor/Codex/Hermes honestly skip with reasons.
- No stdin/tty/injection code exists; compliance boundary baked into file headers +
  docs/work/2026-07-13-comment-back/design.md.

